# README demo: the Desert Palms Software logo, the title, then a raid: off
# the carrier, across the sea, three bombs on the nearest war factory.
# Arcade steering (right on the title). Record with:
#   agk record demo/showcase.agk -o build/demo.mp4 --readme --gif demo/rotor-raider.gif --gif-start 8.5 --gif-seconds 12
wait 230
wait-serial "AGK t0"
wait 90
press right 2
wait 60
press fire 2
wait-serial "theatre loaded=0"
wait 40
press left+up 150
press left 175
wait 40
press fire2 2
wait 45
press fire2 2
wait 45
press fire2 2
wait 150
